---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tier 1 Solar Panels | High Efficiency for Brisbane Homes">
  <main class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <nav class="mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-orange-500 hover:text-orange-600 flex items-center gap-2">
          ← Back to Home
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
          Tier 1 Solar Panels: Why Quality Matters
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-600 mb-12">
          Not all solar panels are created equal. In the harsh Australian sun, choosing Tier 1 hardware is the difference between a 25-year investment and a 5-year mistake.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-16">
          <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What is "Tier 1"?</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600">
              Tier 1 is a ranking developed by Bloomberg New Energy Finance. It doesn't just mean "good quality"—it means the manufacturer is vertically integrated, invests heavily in R&D, and most importantly, is **bankable**. If they are still around in 25 years, your warranty is worth something.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Our Selected Brands</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600 font-medium">
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> Jinko Solar (Tiger Neo)
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> Q CELLS (Q.PEAK)
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> Canadian Solar
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-2">
                <span class="text-orange-500">✔</span> REC (Alpha Pure-R)
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Performance in Brisbane Heat</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
            Brisbane summers can be brutal. Standard panels lose efficiency as they get hotter. Our N-Type panels feature superior temperature coefficients, meaning they keep producing more power when you need it most (running the AC at 2 PM).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-orange-400">The 25-Year Guarantee</h2>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-white">Product Warranty</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Covers defects in materials and workmanship. Our premium panels offer 20-25 years.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-white">Performance Warranty</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Guarantees the panel will still produce ~85% of its original output after 25 years.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-20">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-slate-900">Popular System Configurations</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <!-- Package 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow flex flex-col">
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-green-100 text-green-700 text-sm font-bold rounded-lg mb-6 self-start">
                On-Grid System
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">The Brisbane Essential</h3>
              <p class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">$4,490<span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-500">*</span></p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-grow">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">6.6kW</span> Solar Array
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">5kW</span> String Inverter
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  Tier-1 Jinko N-Type Panels
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  Estimated Savings: $1,600/yr
                </li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/#contact" class="w-full py-3 bg-slate-900 text-white text-center font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                Inquire Now
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Package 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border-2 border-orange-500 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow relative flex flex-col">
              <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-orange-500 text-white px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                Most Popular
              </div>
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 text-sm font-bold rounded-lg mb-6 self-start">
                Hybrid Ready
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">The Family Hybrid</h3>
              <p class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">$9,250<span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-500">*</span></p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-grow">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">10.3kW</span> Solar Array
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">8kW</span> Hybrid Inverter
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  Q CELLS Premium Panels
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  Battery Ready (No extra parts)
                </li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/#contact" class="w-full py-3 bg-orange-500 text-white text-center font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors">
                Select Package
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Package 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow flex flex-col">
              <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 text-sm font-bold rounded-lg mb-6 self-start">
                Full Independence
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">The Power Master</h3>
              <p class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-6">$18,900<span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-500">*</span></p>
              <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-grow">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">13.2kW</span> High Efficiency Array
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">10kWh</span> Battery Storage
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  REC Alpha Pure-R Panels
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
                  Full Black-out Protection
                </li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/#contact" class="w-full py-3 bg-slate-900 text-white text-center font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                Get Quote
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-400 italic">
            * Prices are indicative after STC rebates and assume a standard tin roof installation in Brisbane. Final price may vary based on roof complexity and specific engineering requirements.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="text-center bg-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-12 border-2 border-orange-100">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Ready for a custom design?</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8">Every roof is different. Let us design a system that maximizes your specific orientation.</p>
          <a href="/#quote" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-600 transition-all">
            Get a Free Panel Layout
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
